// this library contains the basic components that are used in every circuit, such as resistors, capacitors, coils, voltage sources and current sources. 
// And the ground flag which is needed in every simulation.
// 
// All texts are presented AS IS and the provider of this library is not liable for any consequences resulting from using it in any way.
